# Each activation of The Mycosynth Gardens has its own X (CR 107.3k), and a copy of one has the X it copies (CR 707.10): its
# new targets are chosen with that X (CR 707.10c, 115.7d), not with the X of another activation of the same land above it.
# Bot1 activates the Gardens with X = 1 at Sol Ring, untaps it with Candelabra of Tawnos, activates it again with X = 2 at
# Gold Pan, and copies the lower, X = 1 activation with Return the Favor (Black Lotus's {R}{R}{R}), choosing new targets:
# Bot1's nontoken artifacts of mana value 1 are offered (Candelabra of Tawnos is chosen), not Gold Pan, which the X = 2
# activation above would allow. The copy resolves first and the Gardens becomes a Candelabra of Tawnos; then the X = 2
# activation makes it a Gold Pan, and the X = 1 one a Sol Ring.

[Bot1 Deck]
The Mycosynth Gardens
Candelabra of Tawnos
Mox Jet
Expedition Map
Island
Sol Ring
Gold Pan
Black Lotus
Return the Favor
Island x20

